import{_ as i,o as a,c as o,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 139 | Realm Refinement · Dao Integration Realm · Planetary Life and Cosmic Beings","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 139 | Realm Refinement · Dao Integration Realm · Planetary Life and Cosmic Beings","no":139,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Dao Integration Realm","Planetary Consciousness","Cosmic Beings","Heaven-Human Unity"],"related":["00-Heng Yuan Zhou Cosmic Overview","14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","24-Anchor Energy Transmission Path","53-Exotic Life Recognition Standard"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0139_模块1-合道境-星球级生命与宇宙生灵晋升.md","filePath":"en/0139_模块1-合道境-星球级生命与宇宙生灵晋升.md"}'),t={name:"en/0139_模块1-合道境-星球级生命与宇宙生灵晋升.md"};function s(r,e,l,c,h,m){return a(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-139-dao-integration-realm-promotion-logic-for-planetary-life-and-cosmic-beings" tabindex="-1">Entry 139 | Dao Integration Realm: Promotion Logic for Planetary Life and Cosmic Beings <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-139-dao-integration-realm-promotion-logic-for-planetary-life-and-cosmic-beings" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 139 | Dao Integration Realm: Promotion Logic for Planetary Life and Cosmic Beings&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 00, 14, 24, 53</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-a-planet-embracing-the-entire-cosmos-origin" tabindex="-1">Introduction: A planet, embracing the entire cosmos&#39; origin <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-a-planet-embracing-the-entire-cosmos-origin" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: A planet, embracing the entire cosmos&#39; origin&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Dao Realm (Entry 132) planet distilled an ecological Dao; Dao Integration must let this Dao &quot;merge into cosmic origin&quot; — per Document 14, Dao Integration&#39;s core is heaven-human unity. A planet&#39;s Dao Integration is when the star core&#39;s ecological Dao is no longer just this planet&#39;s self-consistency, but deeply fuses with cosmic origin laws: the planet&#39;s operating rhythm is synchronized with the cosmic pulse, and the planet&#39;s domain (the entire planet itself) harmoniously coexists with the cosmic law network. The planet for the first time upgrades from &quot;master of an ecological Dao&quot; to &quot;a Dao integration grandmaster embracing cosmic origin.&quot;</p><p>The six top-level axioms hold at the macro scale as well: the anti-predation axiom — planetary Dao integration is symbiosis not cosmic swallowing; the republican axiom of Myriad Races — planets, energy seas, and consciousness entities share Dao integration qualification; the collective ascension axiom — planetary grandmasters&#39; job is lifting the entire planet&#39;s ecology up; the causal self-discipline axiom — rewriting local laws most requires observe-first, interfere-second; the law-first axiom — the legal framework of planetary Dao integration promotion logic is stable and self-consistent, never rewritten for plot convenience, and infinitely expandable without collapse; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-the-dao-integration-of-planetary-life-star-core-embraces-cosmic-origin" tabindex="-1">I. The Dao Integration of Planetary Life: Star Core Embraces Cosmic Origin <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-dao-integration-of-planetary-life-star-core-embraces-cosmic-origin" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Dao Integration of Planetary Life: Star Core Embraces Cosmic Origin&quot;">​</a></h2><p>A planet that has distilled an ecological Dao must complete three things entering Dao Integration:</p><ul><li>Dao-origin fusion: the star core&#39;s ecological Dao deeply fuses with cosmic origin laws, approaching planetary-version heaven-human unity</li><li>Local law rewriting: reconciling this planet&#39;s law operation over a large range, making it more harmonious with cosmic origin</li><li>Domain self-consistency: the entire planet as a domain harmoniously coexists with the cosmic law network and other planets&#39; domains</li></ul><p>The predatory old path is clear here: treating &quot;planetary Dao integration&quot; as a springboard to swallow the cosmos. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s star-core Dao integration (Document 24 transmission path) is precisely the opposite: star-core Dao integration must be dual-confirmed by the Anchor Council and the Symbiosis Court, with ecological symbiosis as the sole purpose.</p><h2 id="ii-the-dao-integration-of-cosmic-beings-energy-consciousness-embraces-origin" tabindex="-1">II. The Dao Integration of Cosmic Beings: Energy/Consciousness Embraces Origin <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-dao-integration-of-cosmic-beings-energy-consciousness-embraces-origin" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Dao Integration of Cosmic Beings: Energy/Consciousness Embraces Origin&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Energy layer life: Dao Integration is &quot;energy fusing with origin,&quot; one&#39;s own energy field synchronized with the cosmic energy sea</li><li>Consciousness domain life: Dao Integration is &quot;consciousness merging with the law network,&quot; one&#39;s own consciousness synchronized with the cosmic consciousness domain</li><li>Law network existences: Dao Integration is &quot;from law self-organization to participating in origin&#39;s rhythm&quot;</li></ul><p>The commonality remains: Dao integration is not &quot;swallowing the cosmos,&quot; but &quot;embracing cosmic origin.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-dao-integration-interface-for-exotic-life-and-multiverse-residual-civilizations" tabindex="-1">III. Dao Integration Interface for Exotic Life and Multiverse Residual Civilizations <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-dao-integration-interface-for-exotic-life-and-multiverse-residual-civilizations" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Dao Integration Interface for Exotic Life and Multiverse Residual Civilizations&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per Document 53:</p><ul><li>Exotic life (void drifters, etc.): Dao Integration is &quot;the drifter finally embracing cosmic origin&quot;</li><li>Multiverse residual civilization remnants: Dao Integration is &quot;the ruined civilization finding its final home in origin&quot;</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-hunting-ground-cosmos-view-vs-symbiotic-cosmos-view" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison: Hunting-Ground Cosmos View vs. Symbiotic Cosmos View <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-hunting-ground-cosmos-view-vs-symbiotic-cosmos-view" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison: Hunting-Ground Cosmos View vs. Symbiotic Cosmos View&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Predatory: planetary Dao integration is a springboard to swallow the cosmos</li><li>Symbiotic: planetary Dao integration is embracing origin and upholding ecology</li></ul><p>The predatory faction treats Dao integration as the endpoint of conquest; the symbiotic faction treats Dao integration as the starting point of upholding.</p><h2 id="v-cross-realm-handover-how-planetary-dao-integration-moves-to-sacred-cross-plane" tabindex="-1">V. Cross-Realm Handover: How Planetary Dao Integration Moves to Sacred Cross-Plane <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-cross-realm-handover-how-planetary-dao-integration-moves-to-sacred-cross-plane" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Cross-Realm Handover: How Planetary Dao Integration Moves to Sacred Cross-Plane&quot;">​</a></h2><p>A planet that has embraced origin in Dao Integration must learn, breaking through to the Boundary-Breaking Realm, to operate its domain cross-plane stably. The key reminder at handover: a planet as a domain, cross-plane is not &quot;moving the whole planet,&quot; but letting the star core&#39;s ecological domain stably connect with other planes&#39; law networks. Cosmic beings at this handover must learn to survive in different planes&#39; law environments. Whether planet or cosmic being, cross-plane operation must go through cross-plane anchor connection filing — the causal self-discipline axiom&#39;s observe-first, limited-interfer-second is executed most strictly at the sacred cultivation stage.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li>Anti-energy waste: star-core Dao integration is the universe&#39;s grandest sleeping wisdom; using it as a swallowing springboard is hyper-scale talent underuse</li><li>Anti-predation: star-core Dao integration, cosmic beings merging — all insulated from swallowing and predation</li><li>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison: the old-era universal welfare system never recognized planets as qualified to integrate the Dao</li><li>Myriad Races full coverage: planets, energy life, consciousness entities, exotic life, multiverse residual civilizations all within 99% coverage</li><li>Hyper-multiverse full openness: star-core Dao integration protocol is openly shared, the macro-scale sixth link of the fully open chain</li></ul><p>&quot;Planetary cross-plane is not moving house&quot; must be made thoroughly clear before breakthrough. An entire planet as a domain, its cross-plane connection is realized through the star core anchor and other planes&#39; law network stable channels, not physically moving the planet. This understanding itself is part of causal self-discipline — if a planet deludes itself into &quot;moving the whole into another plane,&quot; it will inevitably trigger plane-level disaster. The cross-plane anchor connection filing system precisely constrains the planet&#39;s cross-plane impulse within safe channels at the technical level, neither stopping planetary ascension nor letting planetary ascension become a cosmic accident.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>When a planet embraces cosmic origin and upholds its entire planet&#39;s ecology, the cosmos gains a Dao integration grandmaster who has reached the apex of mortal cultivation. The macro-scale version of Dao Integration once again confirms: the perfection of the five mortal-cultivation realms is not the individual ascending alone, but the entire planet being lifted up together toward sacred cultivation.</p><p>Making &quot;planetary cross-plane is not moving house&quot; thoroughly clear is a technical issue and even more an ethical issue. It reminds all macro life: the freedom of ascension always accompanies the obligation of not disturbing others. Cross-plane anchor connection filing is precisely the technical embodiment of this obligation — both releasing ascension and guarding peace.</p><p>In the final analysis, the Dao Integration planetary life and cosmic being promotion described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./00-衡元宙宇宙总览.html">00-Heng Yuan Zhou Cosmic Overview</a> · <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./24-锚点能量传导路径.html">24-Anchor Energy Transmission Path</a> · <a href="./53-奇特生命识别标准.html">53-Exotic Life Recognition Standard</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const d=i(t,[["render",s]]);export{u as __pageData,d as default};
